{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o002a","title":"桥玄与何颙赏识曹操","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o002a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操少年时多不被世人看重，桥玄、何颙却认为他不凡；桥玄认为他有济乱之才。","evidence":["wudi-e-o002a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受赏识","evidence":["wudi-e-o002a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0028","role":"评价","evidence":["wudi-e-o002a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0029","role":"赏识","evidence":["wudi-e-o002a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹操少年时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o002a-q"]},"source_order":[1,18,"O002a"],"order":11}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0028","name":"桥玄","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0029","name":"何颙","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-be6ee1955b4d2400e13d","layer":"original","quote":"嵩生太祖。太祖少机警，有权数〖1〗。而任侠放荡〖2〗，不治行业〖3〗，故世人未之奇也〖4〗。﹝一﹞惟梁国桥玄、南阳何颙异焉〖5〗。玄谓太祖曰：“天下将乱，非命世之才不能济也〖6〗。能安之者，其在君乎！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
